y. It was designed by, and currently houses, the architecture faculty.\n\nThe UC Berkeley website notes that \"Wurster is often voted Berkeley's ugliest building.\"\n\nI visited because I was curious about whether it would in person seem as https://t.co/E1jqFRtkqr", "url": "https://x.com/patrickc/status/2114133364869669105"}, {"author_id": "61559439", "created_at": "2026-10-24T21:24:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114105704089100458"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 224, "id": "2070631956824698880", "start": 212, "username": "JensenHuang"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/sFwMa5NMHh", "end": 262, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/nvidia/status/2114105704089100458/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114105697612763136", "start": 239, "url": "https://t.co/sFwMa5NMHh"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/sFwMa5NMHh", "end": 262, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/nvidia/status/2114105704089100458/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114105697612738561", "start": 239, "url": "https://t.co/sFwMa5NMHh"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/sFwMa5NMHh", "end": 262, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/nvidia/status/2114105704089100458/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114105697759571968", "start": 239, "url": "https://t.co/sFwMa5NMHh"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/sFwMa5NMHh", "end": 262, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/nvidia/status/2114105704089100458/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114105697612836864", "start": 239, "url": "https://t.co/sFwMa5NMHh"}]}, "id": "2114105704089100458", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 67, "impression_count": 98207, "like_count": 1140, "quote_count": 34, "reply_count": 132, "retweet_count": 104}, "text": "Europe has spent generations mastering science, engineering, and manufacturing. That knowledge and expertise can now power AI of its own.\n\n“Let’s work together to build Europe’s AI economy and put AI to work.” — @JensenHuang at GTC Berlin https://t.co/sFwMa5NMHh", "url": "https://x.com/nvidia/status/2114105704089100458"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "166252256", "name": "U.S. Dep